{
  "title": "FY2026 Harbor Light Audit Calendar",
  "path": "engagements/harbor-light/planning/fy2026-audit-calendar.docx",
  "document": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "FY2026 Audit Calendar — Harbor Light"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Prepared by Imogen Carraway, Audit Manager. This calendar integrates the Harbor Light engagement with firm policy deadlines: engagement letter execution, PBC request, time & billing cutoffs, tax return workflow, and the current rate sheet. All dates are tentative pending client confirmation and partner review."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Engagement Milestones"
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Milestone", "Due Date", "Owner", "Policy Reference"],
        "rows": [
          ["Engagement letter issued to client", "2026-01-05", "Partner (R. Okafor)", "Engagement letter template v3.2"],
          ["Engagement letter signed by client", "2026-01-19", "Client (M. Delgado)", "Engagement letter — 2-week turnaround policy"],
          ["PBC request sent", "2026-01-26", "Imogen Carraway", "PBC request template v2.1"],
          ["PBC deadline", "2026-03-02", "Client", "PBC policy — 5 weeks from request"],
          ["Initial planning meeting", "2026-02-02", "Full team", "Planning checklist FY2026"],
          ["Risk assessment completed", "2026-02-16", "Imogen Carraway", "Risk assessment SOP"],
          ["Interim fieldwork", "2026-03-09 to 2026-03-20", "Staff (2)", "Interim fieldwork guidelines"],
          ["Year-end fieldwork", "2026-04-20 to 2026-05-01", "Team (3)", "Year-end fieldwork guidelines"],
          ["Tax return draft to tax team", "2026-05-08", "Imogen Carraway", "Tax workflow — handoff by May 8"],
          ["Tax return final due", "2026-05-29", "Tax manager (L. Nguyen)", "Tax return workflow — 3 weeks"],
          ["Draft financial statements to client", "2026-05-15", "Imogen Carraway", "Reporting deadlines — 2 weeks before issue"],
          ["Management representation letter signed", "2026-05-22", "Client", "Representation letter policy"],
          ["Final report issued", "2026-05-29", "Partner (R. Okafor)", "Issuance policy — PDF only"],
          ["Time & billing closeout", "2026-06-05", "Imogen Carraway", "Time & billing policy — 5 business days after issue"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Fee Budget & Rate Sheet Application"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The FY2026 budget below uses the current rate sheet (effective 2025-10-01). Rates are applied at standard levels; no discounts or overrides are planned unless client negotiations change."
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Role", "Rate (USD/hr)", "Budgeted Hours", "Budgeted Fee (USD)"],
        "rows": [
          ["Partner", "450", "25", "11,250"],
          ["Senior Manager", "375", "40", "15,000"],
          ["Audit Manager", "310", "120", "37,200"],
          ["Senior Associate", "230", "200", "46,000"],
          ["Staff Associate", "170", "300", "51,000"],
          ["Total", "", "685", "160,450"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "PBC Request Summary"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The PBC request will be sent under the firm's standard template, with the following specific items for Harbor Light (due March 2, 2026):"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "Trial balance as of 12/31/2025 and 12/31/2026 (comparative)",
          "General ledger detail for all accounts with activity > $50,000",
          "Bank confirmations (all accounts, signed by January 15)",
          "Aged accounts receivable listing and allowance roll-forward",
          "Inventory count sheets and valuation support",
          "Fixed asset register with additions/disposals",
          "Debt schedules and loan agreements",
          "Revenue recognition documentation for top 10 customers",
          "Expense invoices for testing (sampling list provided separately)",
          "Related party transaction disclosure"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Time & Billing Schedule"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Weekly time entry is required by Friday 17:00. Billing milestones are aligned with fieldwork completion: 40% after interim, 60% after final report issuance. Invoices are generated by the billing team on the first business day following each milestone."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Notes & Dependencies"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "Client year-end is December 31; all dates assume a standard 12/31 close.",
          "If the client delays the signed engagement letter beyond January 19, PBC and fieldwork dates will shift accordingly — communicate any change to the team immediately.",
          "Tax return workflow is integrated; the handoff date of May 8 is firm-wide and non-negotiable.",
          "Rate sheet v4.1 applies; any client discount requires partner approval in writing before budgeting is finalized.",
          "This calendar will be reviewed at the February 2 planning meeting and updated as needed."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
